WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:24,220
Trust that water has more than just knots, Brother Lin

2
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,620
From now on you tell us to go east

3
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:29,300
We will never go west

4
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,700
must give us food

5
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:43,430
Otherwise, you won't even think about living. Everyone, bow your head and don't look back.

6
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:55,140
Run to Lin Yang in the opposite direction

7
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,940
Why don't you take a rest?
